@startuml sequence_uc3_alert_history
title Sequence Diagram — UC3: Xem lịch sử cảnh báo

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "User" as User
participant "Dashboard\n(React FE)" as FE
participant "REST API\n(FastAPI)" as API
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

User -> FE : Chuyển sang tab "Alert History"
FE -> API : GET /api/dashboard/alert-history?limit=...
API -> DB : SELECT * FROM alert_history ORDER BY timestamp DESC
DB --> API : Trả về danh sách nhật ký cảnh báo
API --> FE : 200 OK (JSON Alert Logs)
FE --> User : Hiển thị bảng lịch sử cảnh báo

@enduml
